error[E4101]: cannot borrow `x` as mutable because it is also borrowed as shared
  --> tests/borrows/fail/E4101_loop_back_edge.tarn:32:15
   |
32 |         write(&mut x)         // conflicts only with the loan from the previous iteration
   |               ^^^^^^ mutable borrow conflicts here
33 |         read(keep)
   |              ---- the borrow is still used here
34 |         keep = &x             // crosses the back edge, still held at the next `read`
   |                -- shared borrow of `x` starts here
   |
   = note: a borrow lasts until the last use of the reference that holds it

